### 1. Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

###

### 2. Filter and limit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1

###

### 3. Existing book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

###

### 4. Missing book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

###

### 5. Create book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Pro Spring 6",
    "author": "Cosmina",
    "year": 2023
}

###

### 6. Update book
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Effective Java Updated",
    "author": "Joshua Bloch",
    "year": 2018
}

###

### 7. Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/6

### Flash message — create book
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java Precisely&author=Sestoft&year=2016

### Variant 7 - bulk create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
    {
        "title": "Java Fundamentals",
        "author": "John Smith",
        "year": 2024
    },
    {
        "title": "Spring Boot Guide",
        "author": "Alex Brown",
        "year": 2025
    }
]